{"_v":1,"id":"the-playboy-of-the-western-world-west-end-2025","cat":"west-end","cs":64,"rc":9,"bd":{"positive":2,"mixed":7,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-national-theatre-review-nicola-coughlan-b1262173.html","d":"2025-12-12","q":"A curiously downbeat finale to an uneven evening."},{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2025/dec/12/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-lyttelton-theatre-london","d":"2025-12-12","q":"But there are bumpy transitions between the drama of the first half, with a subtly twisting tension and notes of anxiety, to the physical comedy and outright farce of the second."},{"cn":"Claire Allfree","o":"The Telegraph","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/playboy-of-the-western-world-nicola-coughlan/","d":"2025-12-12","q":"Synge's succulent poetry is frequently unintelligible, almost to the point of inaccessible"},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-an-assured-turn-from-nicola-coughlan-xxvqkw6hr?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqdD7NRKY2DjPPLTBUiSrWL9J3zEDTesWo0Mk774P-xwcpq46lJxtUeD3CrxB2E%3D&gaa_ts=693c27ec&gaa_sig=4_S7ItVVSJytpyXYpF_nD9PVetsX3Ekj_kuYxEEROg0UCL5rDSsuVfpZ9u9EvrFOekVgShWnZDQL3QY8awuBBQ%3D%3D","d":"2025-12-12","q":"Eye-catching, yes, but not quite enough to make the drama seem more than a mildly intriguing period piece."},{"cn":"Holly O'Mahony","o":"London Theatre","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-national-theatre","d":"2025-12-12","q":"It’s a brilliant and satisfying production that will leave audiences thinking long after the show ends."},{"cn":"Fiona Mountford","o":"The i","s":80,"b":"Positive",